{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgsrRcmyEnLX1Q3vK2MSe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I now have enough to choose a fix. The sentinel is the wrong tool here: `web_search`'s availability check would treat `unused` as a real Mistral key, so the note's claim that the value is never sent anywhere does not hold. `VIBE_TEST_DISABLE_KEYRING=1` turns off every Keychain read, Python and Rust, and leaves no fake credential behind. The OpenRouter key still comes from the environment.\n\nI'll make that change in `run-vibe.sh`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1423,"cache_read_input_tokens":72262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1423},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14780817-9f36-48c4-9af1-d2368aca1ec0","uuid":"bfbdd4cc-c19a-4842-bfa7-345d6dbb5790","timestamp":"2026-11-09T18:47:58.630Z","request_id":"req_011CgsrRccXwfXczjs3Qgajt"}
